# Coq (Rocq): The Coq Reference Manual (8.19): vernacular commands, terms, tactics; requirements/languages/coq.md
name     coq rocq v-coq

keyword  Definition Theorem Lemma Remark Fact Corollary Proposition Example Proof Qed Defined Admitted
keyword  Fixpoint CoFixpoint Inductive CoInductive Record Structure Class Instance Module End Section
keyword  Variable Variables Hypothesis Axiom Parameter Require Import Export Open Scope Notation Let
keyword  forall exists fun match with end if then else let in return as Check Compute Print Search
type     Type Prop Set nat bool list option
builtin  intros intro apply exact rewrite simpl reflexivity induction destruct auto unfold split
builtin  assumption trivial lia omega discriminate inversion eauto true false

ident-part     '
block-comment  (* *)  : nested
string   " "  : doubled
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~.
